> sxfetch - a small system information utility for Linux systems.
=================================================================

$ 
    .--.      OS: Arch Linux
   |o_o |     KERNEL: Linux 7.2.4-zen2-1-zen
   |:_/ |     UPTIME: 9 hours, 6 minutes
  //   \ \    SHELL: /usr/bin/bash
 (|     | )   CPU: Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 CPU @ 3.30GHz (4)
/'\._ _./'\   RAM: 8050 MiB / 15936 MiB
\___)=(___/   SWAP: Disabled

$ 

> How to install?
-----------------

    > git clone https://github.com/sakaki91/sxfetch
    > cd sxfetch
    > sudo cp sxfetch /usr/local/bin